01:15:08.200 --> 01:15:11.800
Oh, thank you.

01:15:11.800 --> 01:15:18.100
Yeah, I used to be able
to do brain calculations.

01:15:18.100 --> 01:15:21.250
26 milli electron volts.

01:15:21.250 --> 01:15:23.550
That's room temperature.

01:15:23.550 --> 01:15:26.070
OK, so why I do that?

01:15:26.070 --> 01:15:30.020
Let's go look at the En.

01:15:30.020 --> 01:15:34.550
I'm going to put the
electron into a film.

01:15:34.550 --> 01:15:40.370
Let's say the film
is 100 angstrom--

01:15:40.370 --> 01:15:42.810
