01:16:00.660 --> 01:16:01.910
What's a mass of the electron?

01:16:07.930 --> 01:16:11.770
9.1 10 to the minus 31 kilogram.

01:16:15.830 --> 01:16:20.360
OK, so you plug in the number.

01:16:20.360 --> 01:16:27.050
Here is 9.1 10 to the
minus 31 kilograms.

01:16:27.050 --> 01:16:31.160
Here is 10 minus--

01:16:31.160 --> 01:16:37.890
