01:16:47.860 --> 01:16:50.170
So you do that.

01:16:50.170 --> 01:16:51.535
I have number here.

01:16:57.760 --> 01:17:11.100
I have then En for electron
is 0.6 10 to the minus 21 n

01:17:11.100 --> 01:17:13.440
