01:17:16.770 --> 01:17:27.120
0.37 10 to the minus 2
m squared electron volt.

01:17:27.120 --> 01:17:32.840
So I said kBT is 26
milli electron volts.

01:17:32.840 --> 01:17:36.550
So if you look at the electron
