01:17:50.190 --> 01:17:55.350
So this shows the quantum
effect become important.

01:17:58.180 --> 01:18:06.520
But if it's an air molecule
in this space, the m,

01:18:06.520 --> 01:18:08.320
now, goes 20--

01:18:08.320 --> 01:18:15.210
