01:18:55.270 --> 01:18:59.920
And final comment-- so we
have quantum size effect,

01:18:59.920 --> 01:19:02.080
classical size effect.

01:19:02.080 --> 01:19:05.830
The final comment is a time.

01:19:05.830 --> 01:19:12.570
I shoot a laser, a very fast
